WEBVTT

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
Les Misérables

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.690 --> 00:11.690
Beyond the wind

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
The wind blows

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
I held my knees

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Far away, very far away

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Tooku haruka tooku

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
A gentle voice is calling me

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Let's go look for it

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Attemonai keredo

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
The rain comes down

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.740 --> 01:00.490
on a lonely morning

00:55.740 --> 01:00.490
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.490 --> 01:05.000
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.490 --> 01:05.000
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
the sunlight is peering at us

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Wipe away your tears

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Namida fuite

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Look forward

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Mae wo muite

01:14.880 --> 01:19.180
and summon all of your strength

01:14.880 --> 01:19.180
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.180 --> 01:21.560
Let's walk

01:19.180 --> 01:21.560
Aruite yukou

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
Kitto yukeru

01:23.930 --> 01:31.320
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.930 --> 01:31.320
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.320 --> 01:34.320
forever...

01:31.320 --> 01:34.320
Dokomademo

01:57.730 --> 01:59.580
Welcome home, Monsieur Madeleine.

02:00.110 --> 02:01.710
How is Fantine doing?

02:01.730 --> 02:04.920
She still has a fever.

02:09.110 --> 02:10.890
Thank you, sister.

02:10.910 --> 02:12.510
I will take it from here.

02:12.530 --> 02:14.510
Can you return tomorrow morning?

02:15.330 --> 02:17.100
You're going to pick up Cosette, right?

02:19.000 --> 02:19.940
Yes.

02:21.000 --> 02:23.270
Her strength is fading fast...

02:23.960 --> 02:27.080
Please bring Cosette to her as soon as possible.

02:31.170 --> 02:36.170
Madeleine is Perplexed

02:36.560 --> 02:39.660
Cosette, Cosette...

02:46.740 --> 02:47.880
<i>That s right...</i>

02:47.900 --> 02:51.380
<i>I must reunite Cosette with her mother.</i>

02:51.410 --> 02:54.220
<i>If I confess that I am Jean Valjean,</i>

02:54.240 --> 02:56.970
<i>what is to become of this poor woman?</i>

02:57.370 --> 03:01.940
<i>There are still many things I need to do for this town.</i>

03:05.170 --> 03:06.730
<i>However...</i>

03:06.760 --> 03:08.570
<i>...am I really doing the right thing?</i>

03:08.590 --> 03:13.990
<i>Can I condemn an innocent man to a life in prison in my stead?</i>

03:21.980 --> 03:23.250
<i>No.</i>

03:23.270 --> 03:24.670
<i>I shouldn't worry about him.</i>

03:24.690 --> 03:26.630
<i>Champmathieu is a criminal.</i>

03:29.900 --> 03:31.840
<i>He is an apple-thief.</i>

03:33.490 --> 03:34.680
<i>But,</i>

03:34.700 --> 03:42.350
<i>is Champmathieu's crime so grave that he should
be condemned for life in that insufferable place?</i>

03:44.040 --> 03:46.980
<i>If only there were another option...</i>

03:53.300 --> 03:55.660
<i>I cannot abandon Champmathieu, after all.</i>

03:56.050 --> 03:56.780
<i>Arras...</i>

03:57.560 --> 03:59.240
<i>I must go to Arras.</i>

04:01.940 --> 04:04.290
But Arras is far away.

04:05.150 --> 04:09.500
<i>Even by carriage at full speed, it will take half a day to get there.</i>

04:09.900 --> 04:14.380
<i>Javert will be attending the trial and has already departed.</i>

04:14.910 --> 04:18.220
<i>Will I even make it in time?</i>

04:18.700 --> 04:21.680
<i>That's right... it's already too fate.</i>

04:21.710 --> 04:24.140
<i>Even if I were to go, there's nothing I could do.</i>

04:24.170 --> 04:27.860
<i>This Champmathieu fellow is unfortunate.</i>

04:27.880 --> 04:29.860
<i>It is God's will.</i>

04:29.880 --> 04:32.250
<i>I will leave him in the hands of fate.</i>

04:34.090 --> 04:35.910
<i>There's no need to ponder any further on this matter.</i>

04:35.930 --> 04:38.030
<i>I will forget about what has transpired today.</i>

04:38.050 --> 04:42.410
<i>If Champmathieu is sentenced to work on the
chain gang under the name of Jean Valjean,</i>

04:42.810 --> 04:47.210
<i>my crimes will be absolved and I will be a free man.</i>

04:51.150 --> 04:52.300
<i>Yes.</i>

04:52.320 --> 04:54.340
<i>Only one thing remains for me to do.</i>

04:54.360 --> 04:56.340
<i>I must dispose of that item.</i>

05:10.250 --> 05:13.400
<i>This is the only evidence that implicates me as Jean Valjean.</i>

05:14.090 --> 05:16.200
<i>If I dispose of this,</i>

05:16.220 --> 05:19.410
<i>no one will be able to prove that I am Jean Valjean.</i>

05:23.850 --> 05:26.210
<i>As long as I remain silent.</i>

05:41.870 --> 05:43.470
<i>What is there to waver about?</i>

05:44.160 --> 05:47.480
<i>This will secure my freedom!</i>

05:47.500 --> 05:49.810
<i>I will forget about Champmathieu.</i>

05:49.830 --> 05:52.150
<i>There are still many things I must do.</i>

06:03.680 --> 06:06.720
You must never forget this.

06:06.730 --> 06:11.600
You have vowed to use this silver to help others.

06:15.640 --> 06:17.520
<i>Bishop Myriel...</i>

06:17.530 --> 06:21.260
<i>What am I supposed to do?!</i>

06:43.050 --> 06:44.740
<i>Bishop Myriel...</i>

07:18.210 --> 07:19.990
Bishop Myriel.

07:33.360 --> 07:38.210
Since that day, I have fulfilled my vow and become an honest man.

07:38.230 --> 07:41.220
I have worked towards the happiness of others.

07:42.280 --> 07:46.820
However, I was unable to let go of my past.

07:47.700 --> 07:52.770
That's why I have treasured these silver candlesticks all this time.

07:53.460 --> 07:55.060
Please tell me!

07:55.090 --> 07:57.770
What am I to do?

08:00.670 --> 08:02.460
Bishop Myriel!

08:02.470 --> 08:03.200
What are you doing?

08:03.640 --> 08:04.450
Stand up!

08:04.470 --> 08:05.910
Don't linger about.

08:29.490 --> 08:31.390
Don't worry.

08:31.410 --> 08:34.770
That was Jean Valjean who was arrested in Arras.

08:34.790 --> 08:36.100
Jean Valjean?

08:37.130 --> 08:38.150
Yes.

08:38.170 --> 08:40.820
He is a vile criminal.

08:41.170 --> 08:42.530
You're wrong!

08:42.550 --> 08:45.070
That man is not Jean Valjean!

08:45.090 --> 08:46.450
Somebody help him!

08:47.010 --> 08:47.910
Stop!

08:47.930 --> 08:49.120
I am Jean Valjean!

09:01.320 --> 09:02.670
<i>A dream?</i>

09:09.030 --> 09:10.320
<i>I must go...</i>

09:10.330 --> 09:12.890
<i>I cannot abandon Champmathieu.</i>

09:26.510 --> 09:28.990
Good morning, Monsieur Madeleine.

09:36.440 --> 09:38.330
He's already gone.

09:45.450 --> 09:47.010
Cosette...

09:47.030 --> 09:48.680
Where is Cosette?

09:49.530 --> 09:51.140
Do not worry.

09:51.160 --> 09:54.310
Mayor Madeleine has gone to bring her to you.

09:56.500 --> 09:58.020
Cosette...

09:59.000 --> 10:02.080
We can finally be together, Cosette.

10:02.090 --> 10:06.610
When he brings Cosette to me, I plan to give her this.

10:09.090 --> 10:12.280
I want to see Cosette's joyful face soon.

10:28.570 --> 10:30.680
Cosette, Cosette!

10:31.320 --> 10:32.260
Cosette!

10:32.280 --> 10:33.640
Are you going to sit there stuffing"your face forever?!

10:33.660 --> 10:34.350
Sorry!

10:36.330 --> 10:38.350
Is that you, Cosette?

10:38.750 --> 10:40.660
I thought it was a big mouse.

10:40.670 --> 10:43.270
Éponine, hurry up and go to school.

10:43.290 --> 10:44.610
You'll be late.

10:44.630 --> 10:45.940
Yes!

10:46.880 --> 10:50.530
But not even a mouse would eat this garbage.

10:58.730 --> 11:01.000
What are you doing, husband?

11:01.020 --> 11:02.920
I'm writing Fantine a letter.

11:03.480 --> 11:09.670
That Meille lady was poking her nose where she shouldn't have.

11:10.910 --> 11:12.930
Montreuil-sur-Mer!

11:13.370 --> 11:14.600
Mother!

11:15.910 --> 11:17.560
What are you looking at!

11:18.370 --> 11:20.980
If you're done eating, go buy the groceries!

11:21.000 --> 11:21.940
Wait for me, Cosette!

11:21.960 --> 11:22.410
I'm going too!

11:22.420 --> 11:23.440
Gavroche!

11:23.840 --> 11:27.860
You're going to go work at the shop down the road!

11:35.310 --> 11:36.990
What's wrong, Chou Chou?

11:37.020 --> 11:37.740
Are you all right?

11:38.220 --> 11:39.830
I see...

11:39.850 --> 11:42.290
You're hungry too, Chou Chou.

11:54.660 --> 11:57.760
To send you out like that on an empty stomach...

11:58.120 --> 12:01.390
I will have to speak with the Thénardiers about this.

12:01.750 --> 12:02.980
It's all right.

12:03.000 --> 12:06.610
If you did that, I would just be scolded by the mistress again.

12:06.630 --> 12:11.150
The Waterloo Inn is seeing fewer and fewer clients these days.

12:11.170 --> 12:12.860
Also...

12:15.260 --> 12:19.370
My mother hasn't contacted them lately.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.950
She stopped sending money...

12:22.690 --> 12:24.370
Don't worry!

12:24.400 --> 12:27.250
I'm sure she has a good reason.

12:27.650 --> 12:28.750
All right!

12:29.280 --> 12:30.460
Let's do this.

12:30.490 --> 12:32.300
We'll write her a letter.

12:32.320 --> 12:32.920
A letter?

12:35.570 --> 12:38.890
Mother, are you doing well?

12:39.240 --> 12:41.890
I am doing fine.

12:41.910 --> 12:44.560
Thank you for the sash you sent me for my birthday.

12:45.330 --> 12:47.440
It made me really happy.

12:47.460 --> 12:51.530
I want to see you soon, Mother.

12:53.300 --> 12:55.610
Are you writing a letter too, Father?

12:55.640 --> 12:59.450
I'm asking her to come get you as soon as possible.

12:59.890 --> 13:01.160
Also...

13:01.180 --> 13:03.910
that if she's in any kind of trouble...

13:03.940 --> 13:09.170
she can talk with the priest at the church in Montreuil-sur-Mer.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.920
It will be all right.

13:12.940 --> 13:14.230
As soon as she reads your letter,

13:14.650 --> 13:17.400
she'll come get you right away.

13:18.870 --> 13:20.470
I have to go.

13:20.490 --> 13:22.470
I will be scolded by the mistress.

13:22.500 --> 13:25.700
I will mail the letters.

13:25.710 --> 13:27.770
Thank you, Father!

13:27.790 --> 13:29.310
Wait!

13:38.760 --> 13:40.530
Good afternoon, Father.

13:40.560 --> 13:41.370
You have mail.

13:41.810 --> 13:43.450
Thank you.

13:43.470 --> 13:46.750
Good timing! Can you take these as well?

13:47.150 --> 13:48.540
Yes.

13:51.650 --> 13:53.050
This is...

13:53.070 --> 13:54.270
Is something wrong?

13:54.740 --> 13:57.220
Orders from the church in Paris.

13:57.240 --> 14:00.340
It looks like I am being assigned to another church again.

14:00.370 --> 14:02.320
That's too bad.

14:02.330 --> 14:05.890
Everyone in the village has grown attached to you.

14:05.910 --> 14:07.600
<i>If I have to leave,</i>

14:07.620 --> 14:08.600
<i>what will become of Cosette?</i>

14:10.290 --> 14:11.150
<i>No.</i>

14:11.170 --> 14:12.860
<i>She'll be fine.</i>

14:12.880 --> 14:15.070
<i>As long as the letter arrives safely.</i>

14:17.800 --> 14:19.950
You're late, Cosette!

14:19.970 --> 14:21.780
Where have you been?!

14:21.800 --> 14:22.840
Sorry.

14:22.850 --> 14:24.870
There's a ton of work to do!

14:25.680 --> 14:28.000
Go clean up the guest rooms right away!

14:30.940 --> 14:31.630
Who is it?

14:33.480 --> 14:35.090
Perfect timing!

14:36.360 --> 14:37.880
Can you take this?

14:37.900 --> 14:38.880
What's that...?

14:39.610 --> 14:41.840
A letter written by our Cosette?

14:42.330 --> 14:43.760
Oh, yes...

14:43.790 --> 14:46.140
I just picked it up at the church.

14:46.160 --> 14:47.850
This is great!

14:47.870 --> 14:51.160
Why don't we send them in the same envelope?

14:51.170 --> 14:53.190
That way we won't have to pay for postage.

14:53.210 --> 14:54.860
But, you mustn't do that...

14:55.340 --> 14:57.030
And why not?

14:57.050 --> 14:58.900
Cosette is under our care.

14:59.340 --> 15:01.070
Just a minute.

15:08.390 --> 15:10.370
That Cosette!

15:10.390 --> 15:12.710
And that priest too!

15:34.090 --> 15:36.570
I wonder if the letter will make it safely...

15:37.510 --> 15:38.570
Mother!

15:39.970 --> 15:42.150
Come and get me quickly!

16:05.160 --> 16:07.050
Is the trial still in progress?

16:07.540 --> 16:09.060
Which trial do you mean?

16:09.080 --> 16:10.810
There have been four since this morning.

16:11.290 --> 16:12.950
The Champmathieu case.

16:12.960 --> 16:16.270
In that case, it just started.

16:16.290 --> 16:18.520
The other three were really long.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.650
Good...

16:19.670 --> 16:20.820
Oh, wait!

16:20.840 --> 16:21.860
Unfortunately, all seats are taken.

16:22.300 --> 16:24.360
You cannot enter the courtroom.

16:24.390 --> 16:25.740
All seats are taken?

16:25.760 --> 16:27.780
Yes, unfortunately.

16:27.810 --> 16:32.580
Unless if you were a government official, it would be a different story.

16:33.060 --> 16:36.000
There is still a seat open for government officials.

16:36.020 --> 16:38.250
It's a special seat to the side of the courtroom.

16:39.730 --> 16:43.220
I am the mayor of Montreuil-sur-Mer.

16:54.420 --> 16:56.270
Oh my...

16:56.290 --> 17:00.230
Aren't you the mayor of Montreuil-sur-Mer, Monsieur Madeleine?

17:04.180 --> 17:08.990
We did not arrest him for merely stealing apples!

17:09.010 --> 17:14.720
This man, Champmathieu, escaped from prison several
times and has committed countless crimes.

17:14.730 --> 17:16.870
He is a very dangerous criminal!

17:18.150 --> 17:21.750
Eight years ago, after his release from Toulon...

17:22.150 --> 17:27.930
he went as far as to rob an innocent young chimney sweep.

17:28.120 --> 17:31.320
The name Champmathieu is an obvious alias.

17:31.330 --> 17:33.850
His true name is Jean Valjean.

17:34.290 --> 17:35.560
No!

17:35.580 --> 17:37.730
My name is Champmathieu!

17:37.750 --> 17:40.360
I don't know this Jean Valjean!

17:40.380 --> 17:43.780
I have no idea what's going on!

17:43.800 --> 17:46.650
<i>If only Champmathieu were to be found innocent...</i>

17:47.090 --> 17:48.660
The defendant is to be silent!

17:49.100 --> 17:51.740
I'm just a poor carpenter!

17:51.760 --> 17:54.660
I was very hungry and found myself on a road far away from town.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.710
So I picked an apple from a tree and ate it.

17:56.730 --> 17:58.250
That's all I ever did!

17:58.270 --> 18:01.040
Order! Order!

18:01.070 --> 18:02.710
Because of such a small thing...

18:02.730 --> 18:05.760
I was arrested as an apple-thief!

18:05.780 --> 18:10.680
To boot, I'm being accused of being this Jean Valjean I've never heard of!

18:10.700 --> 18:15.180
You intend to continue denying that you are Jean Valjean?

18:15.750 --> 18:16.770
However...

18:16.790 --> 18:23.230
our first witness, Inspector Javert, has already identified you as Jean Valjean!

18:23.250 --> 18:24.790
I don't know!

18:24.800 --> 18:27.030
I really don't know anything!

18:28.300 --> 18:30.570
In that case, summon the remaining Witnesses.

18:42.820 --> 18:45.500
Chenildieu and Cochepaille.

18:48.490 --> 18:53.220
Do you swear before God to tell the truth and nothing but the truth?

18:53.620 --> 18:55.720
Of course!

18:56.580 --> 19:00.850
Well then, do you recognize this man?

19:01.290 --> 19:03.230
Yes, I know him well.

19:03.250 --> 19:07.070
I'm the one who first recognized him as Jean Valjean.

19:07.630 --> 19:10.740
We spent five years together on the Toulon chain gang.

19:10.760 --> 19:12.200
Without a doubt, it's him.

19:12.220 --> 19:13.320
No!

19:13.350 --> 19:15.080
I don't know know these men!

19:15.100 --> 19:17.200
I've never met them before!

19:17.220 --> 19:18.080
Order!

19:18.520 --> 19:21.870
Cochepaille, do you recognize this man?

19:22.230 --> 19:23.000
Yeah.

19:23.020 --> 19:24.880
That's Jean Valjean.

19:24.900 --> 19:28.710
On the chain gang, he was a man who possessed the strength of a jack.

19:29.110 --> 19:31.840
He's gotten pretty old, but I'm sure it is him.

19:31.860 --> 19:33.590
Without a doubt, it's him.

19:33.620 --> 19:35.010
Very well.

19:35.030 --> 19:36.890
You two may leave.

19:38.450 --> 19:40.310
That settles it.

19:40.620 --> 19:43.350
He'll receive a life sentence.

19:43.380 --> 19:47.730
At his age, he won't survive the hard labor on the chain gang.

19:47.760 --> 19:51.360
However, I suppose you reap what you sow.

19:52.760 --> 19:54.740
With this, I declare the case closed.

19:55.640 --> 19:56.590
Please, wait!

19:56.930 --> 19:59.660
You're the mayor of Montreuil-sur-Mer...

19:59.680 --> 20:00.870
Your honor!

20:01.310 --> 20:03.420
And you, gentlemen of the jury!

20:03.440 --> 20:05.580
This man bears no more guilt than you.

20:06.940 --> 20:08.590
Please release him immediately.

20:09.440 --> 20:11.510
He is not Jean Valjean!

20:11.950 --> 20:13.680
Monsieur Madeleine...

20:13.700 --> 20:16.360
How do you know this?

20:16.740 --> 20:18.350
That's because...

20:20.960 --> 20:24.690
the real Jean Valjean is me.

20:28.710 --> 20:30.190
Mayor Madeleine!

20:30.210 --> 20:32.490
Who would believe such a thing?

20:32.510 --> 20:34.820
There's no way...

20:34.840 --> 20:35.910
Chenildieu.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.030
Cochepaille.

20:37.050 --> 20:40.160
Take a look at me... do you not recognize this face?

20:41.810 --> 20:43.500
You're...

20:43.520 --> 20:44.430
Jean Valjean!

20:46.860 --> 20:50.170
Chenildieu, you have a scar on your shoulder.

20:50.610 --> 20:56.430
You burned your own shoulder in order to remove the
tattoo that identified you as a life-sentence prisoner.

20:58.370 --> 21:03.430
Cochepaille, you have numbers tattooed on your left forearm.

21:03.460 --> 21:05.270
1815.

21:06.000 --> 21:08.560
The year the emperor landed in Cannes!

21:12.760 --> 21:13.570
So, you see...

21:14.090 --> 21:18.240
None other than the real Jean Valjean would know these things.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.120
Indeed...

21:21.470 --> 21:22.830
Everyone...

21:22.850 --> 21:24.470
you have all borne witness.

21:24.800 --> 21:27.800
I am the true Jean Valjean.

21:27.810 --> 21:31.560
I do not intend to disrupt the court any further.

21:31.570 --> 21:33.300
I shall be on my way.

21:33.320 --> 21:37.130
There are still many things I must do.

21:38.030 --> 21:39.220
Prosecutor...

21:39.240 --> 21:40.760
feel free to arrest me whenever you like.

21:41.160 --> 21:43.520
I will not try to run or hide.

21:44.290 --> 21:46.100
I shall heed your verdict.

21:46.120 --> 21:47.350
Excuse me.

22:04.770 --> 22:06.120
Cosette...

22:13.560 --> 22:16.600
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.520 --> 22:20.770
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.520 --> 22:20.770
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.440 --> 22:24.820
I love you, Mother

22:21.440 --> 22:24.820
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.440 --> 22:29.280
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.440 --> 22:29.280
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.280 --> 22:32.660
My precious mother

22:29.280 --> 22:32.660
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.450 --> 22:36.540
As long as you call out to me

22:33.450 --> 22:36.540
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.500 --> 22:40.710
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.500 --> 22:40.710
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.420 --> 22:45.460
My only mother

22:41.420 --> 22:45.460
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.460 --> 22:48.550
in this world

22:45.460 --> 22:48.550
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.880 --> 22:51.680
Hug me tightly

22:49.880 --> 22:51.680
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.680 --> 22:53.680
Kiss me gently

22:51.680 --> 22:53.680
Kisu wo shitte sotto

22:53.680 --> 23:01.400
Always be by my side

22:53.680 --> 23:01.400
Itsudemo watashi no soba ni ite ne

23:01.900 --> 23:04.690
On the path lined with chestnut trees

23:01.900 --> 23:04.690
Maronie no michi

23:04.690 --> 23:09.650
we walk hand-in-hand

23:04.690 --> 23:09.650
Futari te wo tori aruku

23:09.650 --> 23:13.370
If we sing together,

23:09.650 --> 23:13.370
Isshoni utaeba

23:13.370 --> 23:17.540
we can have fun with just that.

23:13.370 --> 23:17.540
Tanoshii ne sore dake de

23:17.830 --> 23:21.750
Bathing in the sunlight filtering through the canopy

23:17.830 --> 23:21.750
Komorebi no naka yureru

23:21.750 --> 23:25.750
Your beautiful eyes

23:21.750 --> 23:25.750
Kirei na hitomi

23:25.750 --> 23:29.380
And that gentle smile

23:25.750 --> 23:29.380
Yawaraka na hohoemi de

23:29.380 --> 23:35.060
envelop me.

23:29.380 --> 23:35.060
Watashi wo tsutsumu no

23:39.770 --> 24:09.590
Preview

23:41.320 --> 23:43.400
Ah, Mayor Madeleine said it.

23:43.410 --> 23:45.180
I think honesty is most important for a human.

23:45.200 --> 23:47.220
Through lying one can live luxuriously.

23:47.240 --> 23:49.810
However, if there are people starving around
you, your meals won't be delicious, right?

23:49.830 --> 23:50.480
That's right!

23:50.500 --> 23:54.270
People who say things like "Hahaha, I don't care about anyone
else as long as I'm doing well!", are probably lonely.

23:54.340 --> 23:56.830
That's why there are hidden societies, winners and losers.

23:56.840 --> 23:59.280
Next episode, Sister Simplice's Lie

23:59.300 --> 24:02.030
Sister Simplice said that lying is a sin, right?

24:02.050 --> 24:04.280
Rather, just hurry up and bring Cosette over here.

24:04.300 --> 24:05.780
Hang in there, Fantine.

24:04.580 --> 24:09.590
Sister Simplice's Lie

24:05.800 --> 24:08.300
Can't they just rush there and bring Cosette at once?

24:08.310 --> 24:09.540
Is it even possible!?

24:24.600 --> 24:29.690
Look forward to the next Episode!
